c v\u00e0 t\u1ea1i sao n\u00f3 quan tr\u1ecdng?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IcGXdLnAFoG6rHxDTN5lRjyrgig\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MKmIdxE3hoytx6xMxz4lwj1Bged\"><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/analytics\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">TikTok Analytics<\/a><\/strong> l\u00e0 b\u1ed9 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch d\u1eef li\u1ec7u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00edch h\u1ee3p s\u1eb5n v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed ngay tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng TikTok. N\u00f3 cung c\u1ea5p cho c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p nh\u1eefng th\u00f4ng tin chi ti\u1ebft v\u1ec1 hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a video, nh\u00e2n kh\u1ea9u h\u1ecdc c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 c\u1ee7a k\u00eanh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FvUwdjnJSoKyKbxuFHclPsxFgBh\">Vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 n\u00e0y v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng quan tr\u1ecdng v\u00ec n\u00f3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1eefng n\u1ed9i dung n\u00e0o th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. D\u1ef1a tr\u00ean c\u00e1c d\u1eef li\u1ec7u th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf n\u00e0y, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n k\u00eanh thay v\u00ec ch\u1ec9 d\u1ef1a v\u00e0o c\u1ea3m t\u00ednh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q0WkdAybXonozjxwVkwlyzFogSg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Lpl7dNKf8ofhrnxxZhWlLHAcglh\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1eadt v\u00e0 truy c\u1eadp TikTok Analytics<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-PlS3dK6hno9hVMxHMgfl4SjCgdd\">\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c: Chuy\u1ec3n sang T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Business<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KxiEdYefGoAvrNxO4bblV89GgtW\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-UG6mds94uoqrS5x1UmFlXexBg2d\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1a4392aa-f217-4af5-9028-af2eb8eeb9d3&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FP9KbbEvCsoYEN5xNrmrlLI3EgId%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;P9KbbEvCsoYEN5xNrmrlLI3EgId&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:210764,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5543\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5543\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5543\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-36.png\" alt=\"\u0110\u1ec3 xem \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok Analytics, \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c: Chuy\u1ec3n sang T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Business\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-36.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-36-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-36-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-36-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-36-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5543\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>\u0110\u1ec3 xem \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok Analytics, \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c: Chuy\u1ec3n sang T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Business<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PIXHdVDyjoNs45xi9qLl9MyUgBd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVWNdDww1ojCwIxYU62ldG21gtd\">\u0110\u1ec3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Analytics, t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 <strong>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Business (Doanh nghi\u1ec7p)<\/strong> ho\u1eb7c <strong>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o (Creator)<\/strong>. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang d\u00f9ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, h\u00e3y chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U0Usd1oEeoFz9SxCOXLlcYBagCf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>V\u00e0o <strong>H\u1ed3 s\u01a1<\/strong> &gt; Menu (bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng 3 g\u1ea1ch) &gt; <strong>C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0 quy\u1ec1n ri\u00eang t\u01b0<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQK5dJ1BfoToPGx0Nu7liwujg4e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u1ecdn <strong>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n<\/strong> &gt; <strong>Chuy\u1ec3n sang T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Business<\/strong> v\u00e0 l\u00e0m theo c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-WsPydIAV7oEOHDx2lWWl3xLogVg\">2 c\u00e1ch truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch (Analytics)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Phipd3LIYo9DyoxGna6lKM03gih\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-A8eedVCiooOdimxrK3ZlfXsFgCd\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;7524b554-da11-4527-80ac-cd72c631cf3e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageU