">\n<div><strong>Th\u1eddi gian xem trung b\u00ecnh (Average watch time):<\/strong> Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 quan tr\u1ecdng. Th\u1eddi gian xem trung b\u00ecnh c\u00e0ng d\u00e0i ch\u1ee9ng t\u1ecf video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n c\u00e0ng h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, v\u00e0 thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n TikTok s\u1ebd c\u00e0ng \u01b0u ti\u00ean ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i n\u00f3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bn60d2JXXoJbzixGLh0l0g64g2f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ngu\u1ed3n l\u01b0u l\u01b0\u1ee3ng truy c\u1eadp (Traffic sources):<\/strong> Cho b\u1ea1n bi\u1ebft ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n t\u1eeb \u0111\u00e2u. T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb trang <strong>&#8220;D\u00e0nh cho b\u1ea1n&#8221; (For You Page &#8211; FYP)<\/strong> c\u00e0ng cao th\u00ec video \u0111\u00f3 c\u00e0ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxMkd6aZAoKacMx8rNylOHrdgNf\"><strong>K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p d\u1eef li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u00fac t\u01b0 duy chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e1t huy t\u00e1c d\u1ee5ng. V\u00ed d\u1ee5, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZVldAlbZo6BTjx2Zu8lvoRKgic\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>D\u00f9ng d\u1eef li\u1ec7u t\u1eeb tab &#8216;Follower&#8217; \u0111\u1ec3 quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e0i.<\/strong> N\u1ebfu bi\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ed3 cho th\u1ea5y follower c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng m\u1ea1nh nh\u1ea5t v\u00e0o 20h t\u1ed1i th\u1ee9 S\u00e1u, h\u00e3y l\u00ean l\u1ecbch \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eefng video quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u00e0o \u0111\u00fang th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u00f3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AsB0dEzPNooRMtx9Jpnl7czQg2f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p &#8216;N\u1ed9i dung&#8217; v\u00e0 &#8216;T\u1ed5ng quan&#8217;.<\/strong> N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n th\u1ea5y m\u1ed9t video n\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 trong tab &#8220;N\u1ed9i dung&#8221; b\u1ed7ng c\u00f3 l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9t bi\u1ebfn, h\u00e3y ki\u1ec3m tra tab &#8220;T\u1ed5ng quan&#8221; xem n\u00f3 c\u00f3 k\u00e9o theo l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 v\u00e0 l\u01b0\u1ee3t follow t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng kh\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TMF4dj8q5o2DOUxk00kliCHCgWf\">Qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e2n t\u00edch, l\u1eadp k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch, th\u1ef1c thi v\u00e0 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng l\u1ea1i t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u l\u00e0 c\u1ed1t l\u00f5i c\u1ee7a vi\u1ec7c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n k\u00eanh m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p. \u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 quy tr\u00ecnh m\u00e0 c\u00e1c <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/dich-vu\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng v\u00e0 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh k\u00eanh<\/a><\/strong> \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u00fap c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9i dung hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SY5bdEvqio5bB6x44telgbzQgdc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-J1qndIyOfo42plxeY7tllyoGgzd\">Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch v\u1edbi c\u00e1c TikTok Analytics Tool b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fqj9dpPLjoVt0gxrzOGlIJwsgJa\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5550\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5550\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5550\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/22fd4a06-e172-479c-9768-6b08a672b481.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1ch ph\u00e2n t\u00edch s\u00e2u h\u01a1n: T\u1eeb s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/22fd4a06-e172-479c-9768-6b08a672b481.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/22fd4a06-e172-479c-9768-6b08a672b481-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/22fd4a06-e172-479c-9768-6b08a672b481-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/22fd4a06-e172-479c-9768-6b08a672b481-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/22fd4a06-e172-479c-9768-6b08a672b481-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5550\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>C\u00e1ch ph\u00e2n t\u00edch s\u00e2u h\u01a1n: T\u1eeb s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-UwZIdkuk3ou4HixKCb5lrX53ged\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;da493359-944c-4e9b-a226-45574d9d268d&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLvRFbeHG3oDWIaxFvL1l5h3hghb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;LvRFbeHG3oDWIaxFvL1l5h3hghb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:679455,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"KCUvdHwRXoD1S5xRYCElgmqwgde\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C2VSdlaJToWRbzxbHPrlPJCqgTe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N8isdHac4o2SL4x4rJDl80IIgjb\">Ngo\u00e0i c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n c\u1ee7a TikTok, c\u00f3 r\u1ea5t nhi\u1ec1u c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a b\u00ean th\u1ee9 ba cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng ph\u00e2n t\u00edch n\u00e2ng cao h\u01a1n nh\u01b0 theo d\u00f5i \u0111\u1ed1i th\u1ee7 c\u1ea1nh tranh, ph\u00e2n t\u00edch hashtag th\u1ecbnh h\u00e0nh, hay \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch influencer. Tuy nhi\u00ean, \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u, vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m ch\u1ee7 ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n TikTok Analytics l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111i quan tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft nh\u1ea5t tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi t\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FWY3dWM1KovOsuxLjfYlNGCsgkh\">TikTok Analytics ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 chi\u1ebfc la b\u00e0n \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u01b0\u1edbng cho m\u1ecdi nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung tr\u00ean h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u00eanh. Vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m ch\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 d\u1eebng l\u1ea1i \u1edf vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ecdc c\u00e1c con s\u1ed1, m\u00e0 quan tr\u1ecdng h\u01a1n l\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ph\u00e2n t\u00edch, k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i d\u1eef li\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ecm ra c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb1ng sau ch\u00fang. B\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch bi\u1ebfn d\u1eef li\u1ec7u th\u00e0nh h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng, <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong> t\u1ea1o ra nh\u1eefng n\u1ed9i dung th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 ch\u1ea1m \u0111\u1ebfn kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3, \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e0i v\u00e0o \u0111\u00fang th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ec3 k\u00eanh c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TlIddvbFMoP6EXxlC1BldtXkgUd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XQnEdg0VOoF7mYxQPD2l5RY0gsf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FnMpdlmeroUMmBxzO45lyb2Lg8f\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CiNPdL9yGogrOWx5SP9lClWZgQe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXbIdAJxhoMK78xlitmlwna7gJi\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4zHdkc9moG0p4xCDsMlPfuCgLg\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1zOdpTlKoctbZx2CeclelbEgNe\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PLSVdBWXkoC8WCxZhallVoJrgfc\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>\u0110\u1ec3 th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean TikTok, vi\u1ec7c s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung hay th\u00f4i l\u00e0 ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ee7, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh \u0111ang ngh\u0129 g\u00ec v\u00e0 n\u1ed9i dung n\u00e0o th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. TikTok Analytics ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 t\u1ea5m b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 chi ti\u1ebft, cung c\u1ea5p m\u1ecdi d\u1eef li\u1ec7u b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebfn vi\u1ec7c x\u00e2y [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":